    "title": "Section 6.3: Array Representation of Stacks & Boundary Conditions",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 6: Stacks, Queues, Recursion, Section 6.3, Page 229",
    "topic_tag": "Stacks",
