    "id": "cm-topic-6-5",
    "title": "Section 6.5: Arithmetic Expressions & Polish / Reverse Polish Notation",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 6: Stacks, Queues, Recursion, Section 6.5, Page 235",
    "topic_tag": "Stacks",
