    "id": "cm-problem-6-7",
    "title": "Example 6.7: Trace of Infix to Postfix Conversion on A + (B * C - (D / E ^ F) * G) * H",
    "book_reference": "Lipschutz & Seymour, Data Structures, Revised 4th Ed., Chapter 6: Stacks, Queues, Recursion, Example 6.7, Page 239",
